<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`nextWake` and `wakeWaiters` carry the settle waits' handshake; `watchReconcile` and `reconcileWatched` tell each watch how the next reconcile ended; `unsettled` lists what the queue still owes. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

